{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01AziAxXKiNHmmx8y1pCJAWK", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lavo_Kingdom\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/History_of_Lopburi\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tou_Yuan\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ipoia_Sanne_Thora_Thesma_Teperat\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.ancientamulet.com/?p=6825\"}, {\"url\": \"https://bafybeiemxf5abjwjbikoz4mc3a3dla6ual3jsgpdr4cjr3oz3evfyavhwq.ipfs.4everland.io/wiki/Lavo.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://EN.wikipedia.com/wiki/Lavo\"}, {\"url\": \"https://kids.kiddle.co/History_of_Lopburi\"}, {\"url\": \"https://thailex.info/THAILEX/THAILEXENG/lexicon/Thailand%20Lexicon%20-%20Lopburi%20(ลพบุรี).htm\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-21T00:01:58.903Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "Lavo Kingdom 10th century Khmer called Lavodayapura", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01L4Kn8yG7TPKM6ydyoVYX18", "content": [{"title": "Lavo Kingdom", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lavo_Kingdom"}, {"title": "History of Lopburi", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/History_of_Lopburi"}, {"title": "Tou Yuan", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tou_Yuan"}, {"title": "Ipoia Sanne Thora Thesma Teperat", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ipoia_Sanne_Thora_Thesma_Teperat"}, {"title": "Historical Foundations: From Mon-Dvaravati to Khmer Hegemony", "url": "https://www.ancientamulet.com/?p=6825"}, {"title": "History of Lopburi", "url": "https://bafybeiemxf5abjwjbikoz4mc3a3dla6ual3jsgpdr4cjr3oz3evfyavhwq.ipfs.4everland.io/wiki/Lavo.html"}, {"title": "History of Lopburi", "url": "https://EN.wikipedia.com/wiki/Lavo"}, {"title": "kids encyclopedia robot", "url": "https://kids.kiddle.co/History_of_Lopburi"}, {"title": "Lopburi (ลพบุรี)", "url": "https://thailex.info/THAILEX/THAILEXENG/lexicon/Thailand%20Lexicon%20-%20Lopburi%20(ลพบุรี).htm"}]}, "The search turned up consistent support for the 10th-century Khmer period at Lavo, with some date discrepancies.\n\n- **Khmer rule:** One source says that in the 10th century, when the city was known as Lavodayapura, Lavo fell under the Khmer empire (In the 10th century, when it was known as Lavodayapura (Khmer language), Lavo was subordinate to the Khmer empire). The Lavo Kingdom article's infobox dates the Angkor vassalage to 946–1052 and gives 1001 as when Angkor destroyed the kingdom (index 1-2).\n- **Absorption:** A Thai lexicon describes Angkorian expansion in the 10th century as absorbing Lavo and erasing much of its civilization (Angkorian expansion in the 10th century absorbed the Lavo polity.). That is a strong claim and may be overstated.\n- **Later independence:** Lopburi regained some self-government in the 12th century and sent an embassy to China in 1115 (index 9-7). Lavo's detachment from Cambodia is usually dated to the late 13th century, with embassies sent 1289–1299 (index 2-4).\n- **Conflicting dates:** The same History of Lopburi article gives the start of Khmer presence as the tenth century in one version (index 7-10) and the eleventh in another (index 6-12). A Wikipedia-derived article on a related city dates a late-10th-century relocation before Angkor's sack in 1005 (index 4-2), while the Lavo infobox gives 1001.\n\nI searched once, so this is limited to these sources, and several of them are general encyclopedia-style summaries. The dates for the Khmer period vary across sources, so check scholarly works such as Coedès before relying on exact years."], "durationSeconds": 6.530497459, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01AziAxXKiNHmmx8y1pCJAWK", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgEQDEC9vKd9TzCbQEuiv", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "**答案：Lavodayapura（ลโวทยปุระ）**\n\n我只搜了 1 次。英文维基的 History of Lopburi 条目写道，10 世纪 Lavo 臣属于高棉帝国，那时它的高棉语名称是 Lavodayapura。\n\n要注意的是，不同资料给出的高棉统治起始时间不一样：有的写 10 世纪，有的写 11 世纪，Lavo Kingdom 条目的信息框写的是 946–1052 年。不过这不影响名称这个答案。\n\n来源：\n- [History of Lopburi – Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/History_of_Lopburi)\n- [Lavo Kingdom – Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lavo_Kingdom)"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1403, "cache_read_input_tokens": 4337, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1403}, "output_tokens": 280, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-21T00:02:02.667Z", "request_id": "req_011CgEQDDvnTagmjaKdExnjH"}
